WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.600
<b>Episode 22: Lucifer and the Biscuit Hammer</b>

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.490
He's erected a barrier around the island.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.160
We can't teleport any closer to the island.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.440
Huh?

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.550
You can't break it?

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.580
It's too powerful.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.450
It looks like Animus poured 
most of his strength into it.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.390
You destroyed his Biscuit Hammer, 
so he's wary of you.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.280
He's afraid... of Samidare.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.960
He's not focused on the battle down there.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.770
Just hit the barrier every now and then.

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:50.730
Like this?

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.570
That'll give them a fair bit of support.

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:04.310
Now, think you can hit me?

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.810
I hit him?

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.110
Fear dampens one's powers.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:15.130
That's our key to winning.

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:34.500
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.660
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.030
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:50.630
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:54.930
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:59.890
<i>Now with your courage, 
let's soar into the sky.</i>

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.520
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:07.600
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.350
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.710
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:17.890
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:21.840
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:25.850
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:33.590
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:52.480
Gotcha!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.950
That was close!

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.730
Swapping places?

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.070
That's a nuisance.

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:14.420
Let me have a few attacks, too.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.400
At point-blank range,

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.050
we can avenge our master!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.870
Unstoppable Spear!

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.260
He shattered?!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.230
Regeneration?

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.720
Now I'm mad.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.870
Here's your payback.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.200
Shinonome-san!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.660
I've got more where that came from.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.300
Damn it!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.580
You're really hanging in there.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.950
Whoa there.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.760
Here!

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:28.890
Did we get him?

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.000
Ahh, jeez!

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:56.510
Even if those orbs aren't fatal,

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.320
they're still strong enough 
to shake our bones.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.530
This is bad!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.140
Mikazuki is taking too many!

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.080
Shinonome-san...

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.690
You're amazing.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.000
But how long will you last?

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.470
Unbreakable Shield!

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:38.520
Hyou-chan?!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.990
Attack, you two!

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.010
Hit him with as many as you can!

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.360
That's right!

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.100
We'll protect you from as many as we can!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.950
Do it!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.230
Right!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.660
Unstoppable Spear!

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.150
Whoa.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:02.390
Shimaki-san!

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:03.750
Shinonome-san!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.970
It's hard work maintaining a barrier.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.430
Huh?

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.420
Above it we have the monster princess,

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:20.670
and below it we have this 
gutsy band making it harder.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.900
It may only be a drop in the bucket,

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:29.360
but I'll be taking back 
the space-time power that I lent you.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:33.080
He lent him power?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:36.160
Akane-kun?

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:39.050
L-Loki!

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:40.540
Hoo, what is it?

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:43.270
M-My wish!

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.880
Prevent the return of my power!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.710
Huh?

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.080
Hresvelgr!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.230
If you long for a future,

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:58.520
then I'll grant your wish, 
no matter who your enemy is,

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.040
my little friend!

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:06.980
Space-Time Ebb!

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:12.650
Takkun...

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:13.740
Akane-kun?

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:18.200
My pain...

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:20.030
Akane...

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:24.680
I see.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.890
So that's the answer to your homework,

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.050
Akane-kun.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.360
Hmm.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:36.760
You're a kid, so I thought you'd get scared 
and side with me in the end,

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.850
but I guess I was too friendly with you.

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.350
Are you not afraid of me?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.730
I am afraid.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:50.690
But I think there's something I want now.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.030
What's that?

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.940
I don't know.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:55.980
But...

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.910
But it's there!

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:10.830
Well, I guess that's it 
for this go-round, too.

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:14.550
I'm sick of playing around, 
so it's time I ended this.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.060
Well...

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:33.890
time for slaughter!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.380
What's that aura?!

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.270
It's Animus.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.100
He's gotten serious.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.340
Samidare.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:54.930
I know.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.140
But this barrier's pretty tough!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.870
Anyway, I'll keep going 
until I punch a hole through it!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.530
<i>He clearly feels different from before!</i>

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:42.500
<i>It's oppressive, like we're 
surrounded by concentrated malice!</i>

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:11.480
An area attack?

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.300
Where is everyone?

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.310
<i>I would have died 
if I'd dodged backwards!</i>

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:29.720
Be careful!

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.520
Animus is hiding in the smoke!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.650
The smoke!

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:51.670
Yeah!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.130
Th-Their wounds...

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.340
Okay!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.580
Space-Time—!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.930
Space-Time Ebb!

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:09.210
Even my clothes?

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.430
Wow!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:15.570
But manipulating space-time 
over such a wide range...

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:19.550
Even if he can restore his own stamina, 
I doubt he can keep it up forever.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.570
Sorano! Akane!

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:31.510
An energy ball from earlier? It's huge!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:44.060
S-Space-Time Ebb!

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.300
Akane!

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:01.160
Space-Time Ebb!

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:13.630
My stamina's recovered, but my mind is...

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:14.510
Akane-kun?

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:15.630
Are you okay?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.630
Time doesn't rewind for your mind.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:29.750
The exhaustion from space-time manipulation 
is etched into your subconscious.

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.300
Shimaki-san!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.230
Hyou-chan!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.460
Shimaki-kun has surpassed the limit 
to create a thirteenth.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:09.560
Akane-kun's just a child, but he kept 
using his power until he passed out.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:12.290
And now, despite losing 
your means of recovery,

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:17.670
you still look at me, a god, 
with fire in your eyes.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.230
I've got to hand it to you!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.720
Akane's a child?

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:27.130
The body's size has nothing 
to do with maturity.

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:30.080
There are only warriors among us.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.090
You're the only child here, Animus.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.550
One, two!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.430
She...

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.930
She broke through the barrier?!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.520
You made him burn through 
a vast amount of energy!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.140
Animus only has a little psychic power left!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.900
Come on, here we go!

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:02.040
<i>She's coming.</i>

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.900
<i>I have to stop her!</i>

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:07.400
<i>I have to wipe them all out</i>

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.770
<i>with a single blow!</i>

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.030
Kusakabe!

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:20.080
Unstoppable Shield!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.330
Zukunft!

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:33.680
A giant Shimaki-san?

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:39.650
Animus,

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.270
what's with that wound?

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:47.240
Our attacks will work now, won't they?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.660
There's no way that will hit—

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.620
This is the first and last time, Nagumo.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.460
It's plenty.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.180
Thank you, Dance.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.180
Animus, you can never destroy the planet.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.910
I can, and I have.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:19.060
Many times before, and many times to come.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:20.640
You were dreaming.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.720
A bad dream.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.120
Go back to sleep, childish soul.

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:30.620
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:34.230
<i>I'm being cornered?</i>

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:35.290
<i>Why?</i>

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:38.100
<i>I've always won before.</i>

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.930
<i>What's changed?</i>

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.110
<i>What's different this time?</i>

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.560
<i>Asahina Samidare!</i>

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.050
<i>If I had my hammer! My barrier!</i>

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.050
Anima.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.670
Animus.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:26.510
Hey, Anima.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.520
Yeah?

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.340
What is this?

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.750
A spear?

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:33.800
It is.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:41.440
Why am I bleeding?

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.880
Probably because you remembered...

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.860
what it feels like to have a body.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:50.050
I don't want to die.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.240
You will die.

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:57.800
There're still so many things I want to know.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.950
Search for them in the cycle 
of life and death.

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:02.220
You might reincarnate one day.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:06.620
You think such a thing...

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:07.720
Who's to say?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.350
Though, I've seen signs.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.120
A scent I've never smelled before 
filling me with nostalgia.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:18.500
A sight I've never seen before 
filling me with nostalgia.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:22.850
Things I know nothing about 
that I like, or hate.

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:27.630
While living my long life as a psychic,

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:31.320
I always felt like the place I belonged 
was right beside me.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:36.840
And it feels like it has 
the shape of a wheel.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.670
Well, that's true.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:48.010
I always felt nostalgia during the time 
between moving through space-time

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:51.860
and manifesting in the Earth.

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.130
I'll go home.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:01.590
Next time, I want to be born 
as an omnipotent being.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:06.270
I wonder if one exists somewhere, sometime.

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:07.830
It does.

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.740
Yeah. There was.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:12.930
I can see it.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.410
In my next place.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.900
That's an awfully long time ago.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:22.410
Such a thing is possible?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.870
Can you atone for the sins 
of your past life there?

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.910
It'll be tough.

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:33.920
I'll probably need 500 years.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.630
I'm going now.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:51.270
Anima, that ring...

00:18:56.450 --> 00:19:02.330
How long are you going to hold 
on to your childhood mem...?

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:14.420
Brother...

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:33.100
I'm sorry I couldn't stop you sooner.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.230
Anima.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:41.860
I'm sorry...

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:47.120
for not being able to cry 
when your comrades died.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:48.660
It's fine.

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:01.160
Anima, what will happen to this island?

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:04.140
Will it fall apart now that Animus is gone?

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:06.830
This island won't fall apart.

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:09.800
Samidare is maintaining it now.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:11.670
What?

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:15.850
This is the end of the tale of Animus and me.

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:19.940
From here on out, this is her tale.

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:20.880
Huh?

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:21.780
Huh?

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:26.950
What do you mean by that?

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:28.970
Hey!

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:31.410
All you Beast Knights!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.310
Attention here!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:41.630
We are now going to crush the Earth!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.190
Huh?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.330
I mean it.

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.390
We mean it.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:53.940
They're serious.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:02.810
Asahina?

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:04.380
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:05.700
Amamiya?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.330
They're both serious about this.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.040
Since when?

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.830
From the beginning.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.740
I always wanted this Earth to be mine.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:26.510
And the only way to obtain this 
huge jewel is to die along with it.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:32.470
I've always been her Knight, 
from the very beginning.

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.380
Here I go.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.480
Ultra Samidare Punch.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.990
Asahina!

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:47.320
Amamiya!

00:21:59.530 --> 00:22:01.790
Amamiya-kun, what are you—?

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:02.800
Pardon me.

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:06.550
Hyou-chan?!

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:12.870
Please go to sleep.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:15.110
You scare me the most.

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:20.150
If you manage to create another golem, 
it could rival the Princess.

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:23.520
Now, then...

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:27.660
Whoever wants to stop the Princess, 
please come at me.

00:22:29.970 --> 00:22:31.460
I'll take you on.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:41.820
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:54.430
<i>Hey, you know, I wish</i>

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>I was the only person in the world.</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:02.630
<i>I didn't want to learn I was all alone.</i>

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:04.980
<i>Ahh, I'm so empty</i>

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:08.350
<i>and I just wanted to shine, 
but I'm so weak.</i>

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:13.120
<i>I was waiting for the courage 
to stop my trembling.</i>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.870
<i>I looked up at the sky I couldn't fly in</i>

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.110
<i>To avoid getting hurt.</i>

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:23.050
<i>But now it's goodbye to that old me.</i>

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:28.310
<i>We smiled, we cried, and 
I learned another side of you.</i>

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:31.760
<i>The pain you hide, what hides 
behind your smile, this world,</i>

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.640
<i>I'll destroy it all,</i>

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:39.010
<i>So I'll run, and I'll fall, 
and I'll still rise up again,</i>

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:43.380
<i>Because tonight I'm coming to save you.</i>

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:55.750
<i>We can become heroes, even from nothing.</i>

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:11.920
<b>Next Episode:
Lucifer and the Biscuit Hammer</b>
